Woe [to you

          {+}
        ], when all men will speak well of you

          {+}
        ! For in the same manner their fathers did to the false prophets.

But I say to you

          {+}
         who hear, Love your

          {+}
         enemies, do good to those who hate you

          {+}
        ,

bless those who curse you

          {+}
