          {+}
         hope to receive, what thanks is it to you

          {+}
        ? Even sinners lend to sinners, to receive again as much.

But love your

          {+}
         enemies, and do [them] good, and lend, never despairing; and your

          {+}
         reward will be great, and you

          {+}
