Be

          {+}
         merciful, even as your

          {+}
         Father is merciful.

And do not judge, and you

          {+}
         will not be judged: and do not condemn, and you

          {+}
         will not be condemned: release, and you

          {+}
         will be released:

give, and it will be given to you

          {+}
        ; good measure, pressed down, shaken together, running over, they will give into your

          {+}
